(14569,'senate',NULL,NULL,'Senate Session',NULL,'https://archive.org/download/rs-senate-20240112-senate-regular-session/ia_video_gd4q3acocj0o6ZvtGqF.mp4','Live and Recorded Public meetings of January 12, 2024 - Regular Session - 10:00 am for Virginia Senate','public-domain','video','00:14:21',25.00,NULL,'/senate/floor/20240112/',640,360,'2024-01-12',NULL,NULL,NULL,'WEBVTT\n\n00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.000\n\n\n00:00:12.982 --> 00:00:15.383\nSen will come to order.\nSenators will please take\n\n00:00:16.252 --> 00:00:18.186\ntheir seats. Those persons\nnot entitled to the\n\n00:00:19.188 --> 00:00:21.188\nprivileges of the floor.\n\n00:00:33.803 --> 00:00:35.803\nRetire to the gallery.\n\n00:00:42.712 --> 00:00:44.712\nThe morning, Senators. This\n\n00:00:48.484 --> 00:00:50.986\nmorning. We will be led in\nprayer by the reverend\n\n00:00:52.155 --> 00:00:54.220\nCranes of Fairmont Christian\nChurch of Mikinao\n\n00:00:55.959 --> 00:00:57.959\nMechanicsville. Yes, sir.\n\n00:01:01.398 --> 00:01:03.165\nYou make up. The senators\nand all in attendance. If\n\n00:01:05.301 --> 00:01:07.301\nyou are able, please stand\n\n00:01:08.238 --> 00:01:10.739\nFollowing the prayer.\nEveryone will Please remain\n\n00:01:12.576 --> 00:01:15.411\nstanding and we would be led\nand the Pledge of\nAllegiance. By Henry\n\n00:01:16.413 --> 00:01:18.413\nHoltzman. Senate page. Out,\n\n00:01:22.219 --> 00:01:24.853\nJackson. Good morning and\nwelcome back. Would you\n\n00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:28.691\nvalue our heads and pray\nwith me? Heavenly Father, we\n\n00:01:29.192 --> 00:01:31.560\nthank you for another day of\nlife another day to serve\n\n00:01:31.828 --> 00:01:34.764\nthe people who call this\ncommonwealth their home.\n\n00:01:35.165 --> 00:01:37.499\nFather here at the beginning\nof this legislative session\n\n00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.200\nhelped this body help each\n\n00:01:40.804 --> 00:01:43.272\none of us to keep our eyes\non serving others. Everyone\n\n00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.275\nin this law in this room\nLord, some elected some\n\n00:01:46.376 --> 00:01:49.245\nemployed some Here\'s\nvolunteers. All of us are\n\n00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:51.880\nhere to serve. Please give\n\n00:01:52.249 --> 00:01:54.317\nus sincere hearts of service\nto serve the people of\n\n00:01:54.451 --> 00:01:56.519\nVirginia. All the people of\nVirginia. Please give us\n\n00:01:57.287 --> 00:01:59.455\nsincere hearts to serve the\npeople in this room. The\n\n00:01:59.923 --> 00:02:02.492\npeople we work with day in\nand day out the people we\n\n00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.360\nagree with and the people we\n\n00:02:05.662 --> 00:02:07.662\ndisagree with. Lord Service.\n\n00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.134\nTrue Service takes courage,\nhelp all of us to be\n\n00:02:10.134 --> 00:02:12.502\nVirginians who are\ncourageous enough humble\n\n00:02:12.569 --> 00:02:14.569\nenough bold enough to truly\n\n00:02:15.873 --> 00:02:18.107\nserve. Major of us look to\nthe brave men and women who\n\n00:02:18.108 --> 00:02:20.877\nwear the uniform of this\nnation. The men and women\n\n00:02:21.378 --> 00:02:23.446\nwho serve on our streets,\nprotecting us and helping us\n\n00:02:24.715 --> 00:02:26.850\nin times of need their lives\nof sacrifice and service\n\n00:02:28.686 --> 00:02:31.254\ninspire us all. Father I\noffer I offer my prayer this\n\n00:02:32.189 --> 00:02:34.791\nday in the name of my Lord\nJesus, the one who came to\n\n00:02:36.427 --> 00:02:38.427\nthis earth not to be served,\n\n00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:45.701\nbut to serve others. Amen. I\n\n00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:48.170\npledge to the flag of the\n\n00:02:48.372 --> 00:02:50.941\nUnited States of America.\nAnd to the Republic for\n\n00:02:51.742 --> 00:02:53.742\nwhich it stands One nation\n\n00:02:54.345 --> 00:02:56.345\nunder GOD. Indivisible with\n\n00:03:04.755 --> 00:03:06.755\nliberty and justice for all.\n\n00:03:16.934 --> 00:03:18.934\nExcuse me.\n\n00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.380\nWill call the roll. All those\n\n00:03:32.851 --> 00:03:34.852\npresent. Please vote. I.\nThe clerk will close the\n\n00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.560\nrole. You have a quorum,\n\n00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.160\nMADAM PRESIDENT. Senate\n\n00:03:44.863 --> 00:03:46.863\nJournal for Thursday, JANUARY\n\n00:03:47.866 --> 00:03:49.866\n11th 2024 Senator from\n\n00:03:52.237 --> 00:03:54.237\nCharlottesville. Senator Deeds\n\n00:03:54.272 --> 00:03:57.410\nmoves that the reading of\nthe journal be waived all in\n\n00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.711\nfavor of waving the reading\nof the journal will record\n\n00:04:01.513 --> 00:04:03.447\ntheir votes. I those opposed\nno other senators ready to\n\n00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:07.450\nvote. Have all the senators\n\n00:04:08.954 --> 00:04:10.954\nvoted. Does any Senator\n\n00:04:12.157 --> 00:04:14.225\ndesire to change their vote?\nThe clerk will close the\n\n00:04:25.237 --> 00:04:27.237\nrole. As 33 nose to rule 36\n\n00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:34.211\n1. 33 nose to rule 36 1 the\nreading of the journal and\n\n00:04:38.584 --> 00:04:40.384\nis indeed waved. The clerk\nwill report any\n\n00:04:41.119 --> 00:04:43.454\ncommunications from the\nHouse of delegates. We do\n\n00:04:44.523 --> 00:04:46.457\nnot have any MADAM PRESIDENT\nclerk will report any\n\n00:04:46.892 --> 00:04:49.460\ncommunications from the\ngovernor. We do not have any\n\n00:04:50.462 --> 00:04:52.462\nMADAM PRESIDENT. Well we\n\n00:04:52.531 --> 00:04:54.699\nhave quickly arrived at this\ntime our morning our where\n\n00:04:55.668 --> 00:04:57.668\nwe will. The welcoming our\n\n00:04:58.337 --> 00:05:00.471\ndistinguished guests. Here\nwith us in the Senate\n\n00:05:02.875 --> 00:05:04.875\ngallery. I will give my\n\n00:05:05.444 --> 00:05:07.444\ndaily reminder that the\n\n00:05:07.513 --> 00:05:09.513\nsenator will rise and\n\n00:05:09.915 --> 00:05:11.915\nintroduce you. And then I\n\n00:05:12.184 --> 00:05:14.285\nwill welcome you. And after\nthat, we will hold our\n\n00:05:16.589 --> 00:05:18.589\napplause until I recognize\n\n00:05:19.825 --> 00:05:22.360\nyou. And so with that we\nwill now hear from Senator\n\n00:05:22.728 --> 00:05:24.728\nMcDougle Senator from\n\n00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.434\nHanover. Thank you, MADAM\nPRESIDENT. MADAM PRESIDENT\n\n00:05:29.835 --> 00:05:32.370\narrives for the purposes of\nintroduction, Senator MAY\n\n00:05:33.639 --> 00:05:35.874\nsay on thank you, MADAM\nPRESIDENT in the gallery\n\n00:05:36.475 --> 00:05:39.144\nwith us today we have the\nReverend Rick Raines from\n\n00:05:39.779 --> 00:05:41.779\nFairmount Christian Church in\n\n00:05:41.914 --> 00:05:44.883\nMechanicsville. Reverend Rains,\nRick has been with us on a\n\n00:05:45.418 --> 00:05:47.418\nnumber of occasions and his\n\n00:05:47.887 --> 00:05:50.288\nalways heartfelt and catchy\ninterest in delivering the\n\n00:05:50.957 --> 00:05:52.957\nprayer and we appreciate not\n\n00:05:53.126 --> 00:05:55.727\nonly the prairie gave us today,\nbut what prayers he gives us as\n\n00:05:56.596 --> 00:05:59.164\nwe go forward each and every\nday. If you could offer him\n\n00:05:59.365 --> 00:06:01.365\nthanks and the warm welcome of\n\n00:06:02.335 --> 00:06:04.937\nthe Senate. Yeas rise, Reverend\nRaines. Thank you again for\n\n00:06:07.206 --> 00:06:09.374\ncoming and you are indeed a\nfix your hair and not that\n\n00:06:11.277 --> 00:06:13.211\nyou\'re old, but We thank you\nfor your prayers. You must\n\n00:06:14.747 --> 00:06:16.848\ndo a bang up job because we\ndo like to hear from you.\n\n00:06:17.884 --> 00:06:19.751\nThank you for all you do in\nthe community. Senators let\n\n00:06:19.953 --> 00:06:21.953\nus give him the warm welcome\n\n00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:38.770\nof his Senate.\n\n00:06:41.808 --> 00:06:44.510\nRecognizes Senator Salim\nSenator from Central Fairfax\n\n00:06:45.812 --> 00:06:48.614\nCounty. Thank you, MADAM\nPRESIDENT. I rise for an\n\n00:06:49.883 --> 00:06:52.218\nintroduction\nSenator has the floor, MADAM\nPRESIDENT and member of the\n\n00:06:55.488 --> 00:06:58.570\nSenate. It is my pleasure to\nintroduce to the Senate today.\n\n00:06:58.492 --> 00:07:00.492\nJennifer Mitchell, mother of\n\n00:07:01.695 --> 00:07:03.763\nSenate Page, Cannibal Run Corny\nis from my District Falls\n\n00:07:06.433 --> 00:07:08.433\nChurch, Virginia. Please offer\n\n00:07:08.602 --> 00:07:10.602\nthem the welcome of the Senate.\n\n00:07:15.108 --> 00:07:17.877\nRise. Good morning to you. And\nthank you for giving us your\n\n00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.790\nchild. We will endeavor to\n\n00:07:21.248 --> 00:07:23.883\ntake very good care of your\nchild. And this is an\n\n00:07:24.985 --> 00:07:26.985\nopportunity that I tell you.\n\n00:07:27.454 --> 00:07:29.454\nIt\'s an amazing process for\n\n00:07:29.523 --> 00:07:32.250\nthem to see how things work\nfirsthand. Up close and\n\n00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.590\npersonal again. Thank you\n\n00:07:35.396 --> 00:07:37.396\nfor coming. Senators Let us\n\n00:07:37.665 --> 00:07:39.665\ngive her the warm welcome of\n\n00:07:46.373 --> 00:07:49.242\nher Senate. Share recognizes\nnow Senator Suetterlein\n\n00:07:50.444 --> 00:07:52.444\nSenator from Roanoke County.\n\n00:07:52.613 --> 00:07:55.281\nThank you, MADAM PRESIDENT.\nI ask that the journal\n\n00:07:56.917 --> 00:07:58.917\nreflect that my seat mate,\n\n00:07:59.386 --> 00:08:01.386\nthe senator from King George\n\n00:08:01.622 --> 00:08:04.357\n. Senator Stuart is away\nfrom the capital on pressing\n\n00:08:04.458 --> 00:08:07.227\npersonal business. Thank\nyou, MADAM PRESIDENT. Thank\n\n00:08:07.261 --> 00:08:09.261\nyou, Senator. The general\n\n00:08:11.799 --> 00:08:13.799\nwill so reflect. Chair\n\n00:08:13.901 --> 00:08:16.670\nrecognizes Senator Obenshain\nthe senator from Rockingham.\n\n00:08:17.772 --> 00:08:19.772\nMADAM PRESIDENT. I would\n\n00:08:19.774 --> 00:08:22.343\nrequest a leave of absence\nfor my seat mate senator\n\n00:08:22.343 --> 00:08:24.343\nfrom Washington County who\n\n00:08:24.345 --> 00