(43,78556,31,'The bill aimed at amending the charter and powers of the city council of Poquoson was introduced and referred to the Committee on Counties, Cities and Towns. It was assigned to a subcommittee and placed on the committee\'s agenda but was ultimately left in the committee without a vote. This effectively ended the bill\'s progress, preventing it from advancing to the full House for consideration.','y','2026-01-09 12:02:00','2026-01-09 12:02:00');
