INSERT INTO `comments` VALUES
(16039,90257,74045,'Michael A','example@example.com',NULL,'127.82.167.234','This is a bad bill as is any bill or law that attempts to minimize punishment for crimes against persons or property. It sends the wrong message to both the criminal and victim communities. Please withdraw it.','comment','published','n','2024-01-15 20:26:22','2024-01-15 20:26:22'),
(16040,5059,74045,'Waldo Jaquith','example@example.com','https://waldo.jaquith.org/','127.107.252.14','...you object to a bill that shaves <em>one day</em> off sentencing guidelines?','comment','published','n','2024-01-15 20:38:44','2024-01-15 20:38:44'),
(16041,90236,74045,'Bill Peabody','example@example.com',NULL,'127.11.92.4','The purpose of this bill is to circumvent fed immigration laws.','comment','published','n','2024-01-15 21:12:55','2024-01-15 21:12:55'),
(16058,90281,74045,'Lou Di Leonardo','example@example.com',NULL,'127.200.46.30','Where are you, Waldo?  This bill shaves a single day so that illegal aliens will NOT be deported since their punishment was less than a calendar year.  Don\'t be fooled.','comment','published','n','2024-01-17 22:07:02','2024-01-17 22:07:02'),
(16060,5059,74045,'Waldo Jaquith','example@example.com','https://waldo.jaquith.org/','127.223.7.182','For starters, don\'t be an ass.\n\nMichael objected to the bill as \"send[ing] the wrong message to both the criminal and victim communities.\" He didn\'t object to violations of immigration requirements, he said that reducing penalties by <em>one day</em> was unfair to victims. That is absurd.','comment','published','n','2024-01-17 22:15:05','2024-01-17 22:15:05'),
(16084,90248,74045,'Lou Di Leonardo','example@example.com',NULL,'127.10.177.86','Waldo, Waldo, Waldo.  Michael\'s objection is valid but why is it important that he spell out for you exactly what he meant?  He must have erroneously assumed you understood.  But, you didn\'t so I explained the situation for you.  You\'re welcome.','comment','published','n','2024-01-19 19:47:24','2024-01-19 19:47:24'),
(16087,5059,74045,'Waldo Jaquith','example@example.com','https://waldo.jaquith.org/','127.242.67.70','It\'s amazing that you can infer that from his comment that is completely unrelated to your own!','comment','published','n','2024-01-19 20:52:33','2024-01-19 20:52:33'),
(16174,90469,74045,'Norma Margulies','example@example.com',NULL,'127.44.152.34','The intention of this Bill is pretty clear - a vile and cynical maneuver to circumvent fed immigration legislation.  In reality, it is part of a larger strategy undertaken by the Democratic party. We will see how this strategy will play out at the polls in November.','comment','published','n','2024-02-01 20:07:02','2024-02-01 20:07:02');
