INSERT INTO `comments` VALUES
(16105,90320,74452,'Bill Peabody','example@example.com',NULL,'127.235.190.116','Avoid the \"harm\" of a 180lb male crashing into a 135lb female.\nVote yes','comment','published','n','2024-01-21 12:06:57','2024-01-21 12:06:57'),
(16114,5059,74452,'Waldo Jaquith','example@example.com','https://waldo.jaquith.org/','127.164.227.146','Maybe it\'s just me, but I think it\'s weird and wrong to refuse to let kids play high school sports because they\'re too small or large compared to the average participant.','comment','published','n','2024-01-21 19:50:50','2024-01-21 19:50:50'),
(16185,90512,74452,'Mary Keleher','example@example.com',NULL,'127.52.112.221','Waldo Jaquith, You don\'t think it\'s weird or wrong then men are now being crowned champions in women\'s sports? This bill isn\'t preventing any child from playing sports. This bill is to prevent biological males from competing in women\'s sports. Boys and men can still compete on boy\'s teams and men\'s teams.','comment','published','n','2024-02-05 20:55:53','2024-02-05 20:55:53'),
(16186,5059,74452,'Waldo Jaquith','example@example.com','https://waldo.jaquith.org/','127.38.5.61','Yeah, this is not a real problem. You might as well complain that golden retrievers keep winning basketball tournaments because you once watched <em>Air Bud.</em> There are no \"men being crowned champions in women\'s sports\" in Virginia. Not one. This is legislation about a thing that isn\'t a real problem that has been whipped up by far-right creeps in order to make you angry. There is absolutely no definition of \"biological males\" that can pass muster. It doesn\'t exist. Will we exclude boys who have gynecomastia? Girls with elevated testosterone levels? Boys with Klinefelter syndrome? Boys with elevated estrogen levels? Girls with oversized clitorises? Don\'t you think it is extremely gross and bad that you and I are discussing the size of children\'s genitalia?\r\n\r\nThis bill would allow absolutely anybody to challenge the gender of any child playing sports. Do you know how offensive and damaging that is to a child? For an adult to declare \"you are not a real girl,\" and then the girl has to have her genitals examined by a doctor to prove to the creepy parent that they really are a girl? What if that\'s how the girl discovers that she\'s one of the millions of Americans who lie between sexes? Is anybody who isn\'t 100% girl (whatever that even <em>means</em>) automatically a boy?\r\n\r\nOne thing I like to do is <em>not think about children\'s genitals.</em> There are no boys out there pretending to be girls so they that can, like, dominate at field hockey or whatever, any more than there are golden retrievers winning basketball tournaments because, hey, there\'s no rule against it. This is a law that requires that teachers pay real close attention to kids\' genitals. Stop paying attention to kids\' genitals. Stop doing that. It\'s super disgusting.','comment','published','n','2024-02-05 21:18:03','2024-02-05 21:18:03'),
(16188,90299,74452,'Will Weaver','example@example.com',NULL,'127.84.95.226','This is yet another creepy anti-trans bill that needs to be defeated just like the others. Waldo does an incredible job of explaining exactly what is problematic with it. Not to mention it erases intersex people like pretty much all the other bills like this do.\n\nAlso, Waldo, golden retrievers winning basketball tournaments is definitely a concern considering the UMBC Retrievers upset #1 UVA back in 2018. ;)','comment','published','n','2024-02-06 14:25:35','2024-02-06 14:25:35'),
(16193,90534,74452,'Donna','example@example.com',NULL,'127.78.65.167','Delores Oates launched her campaign by discriminating against the LGBTQ community in her home county of Warren after she tried to get their books banned and public library closed. So this bill she has introduced isn’t shocking at all.','comment','published','n','2024-02-07 19:47:06','2024-02-07 19:47:06');
