INSERT INTO `comments` VALUES
(16200,90545,73896,'Michael William Albin','example@example.com',NULL,'127.204.108.17','Stop assisted suicide legislation now!','comment','published','n','2024-02-08 20:28:17','2024-02-08 20:28:17'),
(16209,90578,73896,'Justin West','example@example.com',NULL,'127.124.51.180','As a Virginia resident and sovereign human being, I should be empowered to make my own end-of-life decisions if I am diagnosed with a terminal illness. I want to be alert, independent, and able to spend time with my loved ones in my final days. \n\nThat is what SB280 would provide. \n\nMore than 70 million Americans in ten states and Washington D.C. already have access to Death with Dignity. As Congresswoman Jennifer Wexton wrote to the committee, “If this bill becomes law in Virginia, it would return the control over to [patients] when, where, and how our stories end, not to the diseases. And that’s the greatest gift you, our elected representatives, can give us.”\n\nDeath with dignity is scandalous to some, including fellow commenter Mr. Albin. It\'s curious how the people dying demented and hopeless, connected to half a dozen tubes in ICU rooms, aren’t considered scandals by anybody. That’s just \"the natural way of things\".\n\n<strong>\"If I cannot give consent to my own death, whose body is this? Who owns my life?\" - Sue Rodriguez <strong>','comment','deleted','n','2024-02-11 01:31:59','2024-02-11 01:31:59');
