(41897,74670,'FH1122',NULL,'<p>According to the Fiscal Impact Statement, this legislation is estimated to have a minimal fiscal impact. There would be costs associated with the Board of Medicine and the Board of Nursing to promulgate regulations, but these costs can be handled within existing resources. No specific agency or political subdivisions are mentioned as being affected by this legislation.</p><p>Summary generated automatically by OpenAI.</p>','2025-01-12 03:10:40','2025-01-12 03:10:40');
